// Title: Capture Credentials with Rpcping.exe
// ID: 93671f99-04eb-4ab4-a161-70d446a84003
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Julia Fomina, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-09
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003
// Description: Detects using Rpcping.exe to send a RPC test connection to the target server (-s) and force the NTLM hash to be sent in the process.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "-s" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "/s")) AND ((src.process.image.path endswithCIS "\\RpcPing.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "\\RpcPing.exe"))) AND (((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "-t" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "/t") AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS "ncacn_np") OR ((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "-u" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "/u") AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS "NTLM")))
